      "snippet": "\n94 Wn.2d 51 (1980)\n615 P.2d 440\nFEDERATED PUBLICATIONS, INC., Petitioner,\nv.\nJ.S. KURTZ, ET AL, Respondents.\nNo. 46124.\nThe Supreme Court of Washington, En Banc.\nJuly 24, 1980.\n*52 Beaty & Childress, by Robert E. Beaty (Robert C. Bernius and Nixon, Hargrave, Devans & Doyle,<",
